  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: Star Wars Saga Edition Core Rulebook</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You are adept at fighting <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Unarmed\">Unarmed</a>.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Damage dealt by your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks\" title=\"Unarmed Attacks\">Unarmed Attacks</a> increases by one die step. In addition, you gain a +1 dodge bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>. Additionally, you do not provoke <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity\" title=\"Attacks of Opportunity\">Attacks of Opportunity</a> with <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Unarmed_Attacks\" title=\"Unarmed Attacks\">Unarmed Attacks</a>.</p><p><b>Special:</b> A situation that makes you lose your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a> (if any) also makes you lose any dodge bonuses. Also, dodge bonuses stack with each other, unlike most other types of bonuses.</p>",
